# Lichess Titled Opponents & Stats

## Installation

1. Install Tampermonkey: https://www.tampermonkey.net/
2. Install the script: https://github.com/shinymanstudios-a11y/lichess-titled-opponents/raw/refs/heads/main/lichess-titled-opponents.user.js
3. Go to any Lichess profile and click the Titled Opponents button in the bottom right.
